    "detailed_description": "<i><u><strong>Storyline:</strong></u></i><br>In 1750, right after Europe\u2019s great plague came to an end, the catholic church saw a significant increase in cases of possession and unnatural phenomena. Thinking that this situation may grow out of proportion, a few Cardinals founded a secret organization called Ordo Lucis Templariorum, Order of the Light Templars, to investigate and solve all the unnatural cases.<br><br>On September 10th 2015, rumors of an unnatural event that had occurred a few days prior in a small village called Creekwell got to the ears of the Light Templars.  They sent the young priest Edward Davies to investigate the deeds that took place in Creekwell Village.<br><br><br><br><i><u><strong>Gameplay:</strong></u></i><br>Investigate what happened in Creekwell Village and uncover the truth while defending yourself from the creatures inhabiting the land.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2202380/extras/4eae21ff015e749a0b02ee641949b700.poster.avif?t=1684501202\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2202380/extras/4eae21ff015e749a0b02ee641949b700.webm?t=1684501202\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2202380/extras/4eae21ff015e749a0b02ee641949b700.mp4?t=1684501202\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Search for objects to help you in your journey and clues to help you progress throughout the story.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2202380/extras/2037b5f2e0a40a9939ab68d938296cdf.poster.avif?t=1684501202\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2202380/extras/2037b5f2e0a40a9939ab68d938296cdf.webm?t=1684501202\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2202380/extras/2037b5f2e0a40a9939ab68d938296cdf.mp4?t=1684501202\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
